    <!-- The privacy statement: "Tetto sends nothing", and what Android's backup does (CLAUDE.md). -->
    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_headline">No account, no ads, no tracking.</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">Tetto has no internet permission at all, so it cannot send your caps or your spends anywhere: Tetto sends nothing. They are kept on this phone. Android’s own backup, if you turned it on, keeps a copy of them and of your settings in your Google account, encrypted with your screen lock.</string>

